abstract: >-
  Kernel-checked computable evidence for the level-26 route in a conditional
  formal Beal-conjecture endgame. The release derives the finite mod-3 matrix
  from normalized eigenform coefficients and an explicit basis change, checks
  its determinant, and replays the finite descent ledger without claiming the
  still-missing cohomological Selmer or Abel-Jacobi comparison theorems.